      "english": "Small People"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，小乐对保罗说：“保罗，你好高啊！”",
      "traditional": "一天，小樂對保羅說：“保羅，你好高啊！”",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān xiǎo lè duì bǎo luó shuō bǎo luó nǐ hǎo gāo a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "保罗说：“不是我很高，是因为你们都是小人。”",
      "traditional": "保羅說：“不是我很高，是因為你們都是小人。”",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shuō bú shì wǒ hěn gāo shì yīn wèi nǐ men dōu shì xiǎo rén",
      "english": "One day, Little Le said to Paul: “Paul, you're so tall!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐听后，很生气地走了。",
      "traditional": "小樂聽後，很生氣地走了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tīng hòu hěn shēng qì de zǒu le",
      "english": "Paul said: “It's not that I'm tall, it's because you are all small people.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When Little Le heard this, she got angry and walked away."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗感到很奇怪：我只是想说中国的女孩长得比较小，很可爱，",
      "traditional": "保羅感到很奇怪：我只是想說中國的女孩長得比較小，很可愛，",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó gǎn dào hěn qí guài wǒ zhǐ shì xiǎng shuō zhōng guó de nǚ hái zhǎng de bǐ jiào xiǎo hěn kě ài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "为什么小乐那么生气呢？",
      "traditional": "為什麼小樂那麼生氣呢？",
      "pinyin": "wèi shén me xiǎo lè nà me shēng qì ne",
      "english": "Paul was confused: I just wanted to say that Chinese girls are relatively short and cute."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How come Little Le got so angry?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "那是因为中文里“小人”有另外一个意思，",
      "traditional": "那是因為中文裡“小人”有另外一個意思，",
      "pinyin": "nà shì yīn wèi zhōng wén lǐ xiǎo rén yǒu lìng wài yí ge yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "是指“喜欢打小报告的人”，是一个不好的词。",
      "traditional": "是指“喜歡打小報告的人”，是一個不好的詞。",
      "pinyin": "shì zhǐ xǐ huan dǎ xiǎo bào gào de rén shì yí ge bù hǎo de cí",
      "english": "That is because in Chinese, “small person” also has another meaning."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "虽然以前“小人”也指“长得小的人”或“小孩”，但是现在很少用了。",
      "traditional": "雖然以前“小人”也指“長得小的人”或“小孩”，但是現在很少用了。",
      "pinyin": "suī rán yǐ qián xiǎo rén yě zhǐ zhǎng de xiǎo de rén huò xiǎo hái dàn shì xiàn zài hěn shǎo yòng le",
      "english": "It refers to someone who “likes to tell on people”, and is not a good word."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "现在中国人听到“小人”，都会觉得你在骂他。",
      "traditional": "現在中國人聽到“小人”，都會覺得你在罵他。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài zhōng guó rén tīng dào xiǎo rén dōu huì jué de nǐ zài mà tā",
      "english": "Even though “small person” formerly also meant a “small grown person” or “child”, nowadays it is rarely used."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "所以小乐听到保罗说她是“小人”，当然就生气了。",
      "traditional": "所以小樂聽到保羅說她是“小人”，當然就生氣了。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ xiǎo lè tīng dào bǎo luó shuō tā shì xiǎo rén dāng rán jiù shēng qì le",
      "english": "Nowadays, when Chinese people hear the word “small person”, they will assume they're being scolded."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So when Little Le heard Paul calling her a “small person”, of course she got angry."
    }
  ],
